    "title": "Six Area Golfers Qualify for District 3 Tournament - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Free Press Publisher ,\n1 days ago Six Franklin County golfers qualified for the District 3 tournament during Tuesday’s Mid Penn Championships at Range End Golf Club. Shippensburg’s Kaydee Beckenbaugh won the girls championship with a 4-over-par 75, finishing six strokes ahead of the field. Waynesboro’s Abby Byers placed 10th with an 89, while Chambersburg’s Abby Rensch qualified with a 98. Read full article",
